# No router detected — App.tsx renders components directly

There is no React Router or any other routing library installed.
App.tsx is the single root component. It manages "view state" through:

  showWelcome (boolean)     — shows WelcomeScreen vs message list
  settingsOpen (boolean)    — shows SettingsModal overlay
  openRetrieval (object)    — shows RetrievalPanel side drawer
  activeId (string)         — which session is active in the Sidebar

All navigation is controlled by local state in App.tsx / ChatApp().
No URL-based routing exists in this codebase.
